#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:4
msgid "v4.8.10"
msgstr "v4.8.10"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.8.10 adds support for the OpenMV AE3 board and refreshes the bundled AI "
"toolchains, updating the Ethos-U Vela NPU compiler to 5.0.0 and the ST Edge "
"AI tools to 4.0.0. This release remains based on Qt Creator 14.0.2, with no "
"rebase, and contains no breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"v4.8.10은 OpenMV AE3 보드에 대한 지원을 추가하고 번들된 AI 툴체인을 갱신하여, Ethos-U Vela NPU 컴파일러를"
" 5.0.0으로, ST Edge AI 도구를 4.0.0으로 업데이트합니다. 이 릴리스는 리베이스 없이 Qt Creator 14.0.2를 "
"그대로 기반으로 하며 호환성에 영향을 주는 변경을 포함하지 않습니다."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:14
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "이 페이지에서"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:17
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "주요 사항"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:19
msgid ""
"**OpenMV AE3** Alif Ensemble E3 board is now supported, including "
"``alif_tools`` bootloader/DFU programming and per-core Ethos-U55 NPU "
"acceleration."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV AE3** Alif Ensemble E3 보드가 이제 지원되며, ``alif_tools`` 부트로더/DFU 프로그래밍과 "
"코어별 Ethos-U55 NPU 가속을 포함합니다."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Ethos-U Vela** NPU model compiler updated from 4.2.0 to 5.0.0, rebuilt "
"against the Python 3.13 ABI."
msgstr ""
"**Ethos-U Vela** NPU 모델 컴파일러가 4.2.0에서 5.0.0으로 업데이트되어 Python 3.13 ABI에 맞게 다시 "
"빌드되었습니다."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:24
msgid ""
"**ST Edge AI** (``stedgeai``) model conversion tools updated from 3.0.0 to "
"4.0.0 on all platforms."
msgstr ""

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Faster connection fallback:** the IDE now gives up on a failed camera "
"connection after 2 reconnect attempts instead of 10."
msgstr "**더 빠른 연결 폴백:** IDE가 이제 실패한 카메라 연결을 10회가 아닌 2회의 재연결 시도 후에 포기합니다."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:30
msgid "New features"
msgstr "새로운 기능"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:32
msgid ""
"**OpenMV AE3** Alif Ensemble E3 board support (internal codename \"AE3 "
"classic\"). Adds the ``AE3`` / ``OPENMV AE3 SBL2`` board type, with the IDE "
"display name ``OpenMV AE3 SBL2`` (VID:PID ``37C5:16E3``), ``alif_tools`` "
"bootloader/DFU programming, a dual-core (HP/HE) romfs layout, and per-core "
"Ethos-U55 Vela NPU acceleration configs (High Performance Core "
"``ethos-u55-256``, High Efficiency Core ``ethos-u55-128``). The board is a "
"hidden/DFU-programmed target reached via its bootloader VID:PID mappings "
"rather than a normally listed selectable connect target (`adbed3825 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/adbed3825>`__)."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV AE3** Alif Ensemble E3 보드 지원(내부 코드명 \"AE3 classic\"). IDE 표시 이름이 "
"``OpenMV AE3 SBL2``(VID:PID ``37C5:16E3``)인 ``AE3`` / ``OPENMV AE3 SBL2`` 보드"
" 유형을 추가하며, ``alif_tools`` 부트로더/DFU 프로그래밍, 듀얼 코어(HP/HE) romfs 레이아웃, 코어별 "
"Ethos-U55 Vela NPU 가속 구성(High Performance Core ``ethos-u55-256``, High "
"Efficiency Core ``ethos-u55-128``)을 포함합니다. 이 보드는 일반적으로 나열되는 선택 가능한 연결 대상이 "
"아니라 부트로더 VID:PID 매핑을 통해 접근하는 숨겨진/DFU 프로그래밍 대상입니다 (`adbed3825 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/adbed3825>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:43
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "기타 변경 및 개선"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:45
msgid ""
"Reduced the maximum number of automatic camera reconnect attempts from 10 to"
" 2, so the IDE gives up faster on a failed connection (`2ddecec53 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/2ddecec53>`__)."
msgstr ""
"자동 카메라 재연결 시도의 최대 횟수를 10회에서 2회로 줄여, IDE가 실패한 연결을 더 빠르게 포기하도록 했습니다 "
"(`2ddecec53 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/2ddecec53>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:48
msgid ""
"Updated the bundled **Ethos-U Vela** NPU model compiler from 4.2.0 to 5.0.0 "
"on Windows, Linux, and macOS arm64, rebuilt against the Python 3.13 ABI with"
" the ``regor`` and ``mlw_codec`` binaries recompiled and the bundled "
"``numpy`` updated to 2.4.4 across all platforms (`be9d29d9d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/be9d29d9d>`__, `04c73f187 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/04c73f187>`__, `93260af21 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/93260af21>`__, `a58458cfb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a58458cfb>`__, `a6e1ac7ed "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a6e1ac7ed>`__)."
msgstr ""
"번들된 **Ethos-U Vela** NPU 모델 컴파일러를 Windows, Linux, macOS arm64에서 4.2.0에서 "
"5.0.0으로 업데이트하여 Python 3.13 ABI에 맞게 다시 빌드했으며, ``regor`` 및 ``mlw_codec`` 바이너리를"
" 재컴파일하고 번들된 ``numpy``\\ 를 모든 플랫폼에서 2.4.4로 업데이트했습니다 (`be9d29d9d "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/be9d29d9d>`__, `04c73f187 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/04c73f187>`__, `93260af21 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/93260af21>`__, `a58458cfb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a58458cfb>`__, `a6e1ac7ed "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/a6e1ac7ed>`__)."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:57
msgid ""
"Updated the bundled **ST Edge AI** (``stedgeai``) model conversion tools "
"from 3.0.0 to 4.0.0 on Windows, Linux, and macOS arm64 (`1a727567c "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/1a727567c>`__, `8dcfd8472 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/8dcfd8472>`__, `27aabc740 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/27aabc740>`__)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:64
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "플랫폼 및 도구 지원"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:66
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 14.0.2."
msgstr "**Qt Creator 기반:** 14.0.2."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:67
msgid ""
"**New board:** OpenMV AE3 SBL2 (Alif Ensemble E3), a hidden/DFU-programmed "
"target programmed via ``alif_tools`` with dual-core Ethos-U55 NPU "
"acceleration."
msgstr ""
"**새 보드:** OpenMV AE3 SBL2(Alif Ensemble E3), 듀얼 코어 Ethos-U55 NPU 가속을 갖추고 "
"``alif_tools``\\ 를 통해 프로그래밍되는 숨겨진/DFU 프로그래밍 대상입니다."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:70
msgid ""
"**Ethos-U Vela** NPU compiler: 4.2.0 -> 5.0.0 (Windows, Linux, macOS arm64),"
" reinstalled against the Python 3.13 ABI."
msgstr ""
"**Ethos-U Vela** NPU 컴파일러: 4.2.0 -> 5.0.0 (Windows, Linux, macOS arm64), "
"Python 3.13 ABI에 맞게 재설치되었습니다."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v4.8.10.rst:72
msgid ""
"**ST Edge AI** (``stedgeai``) tools: 3.0.0 -> 4.0.0 (Windows, Linux, macOS "
